{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"SUSE-SU-2026:4628-1","published":"2026-10-12T14:58:46Z","modified":"2026-10-13T10:30:05.946541838Z","related":["CVE-2026-44740","CVE-2026-56854","CVE-2026-56855","CVE-2026-71556","CVE-2026-71557","CVE-2026-78662","CVE-2026-84303","CVE-2026-84304","CVE-2026-84445"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-44740","CVE-2026-56854","CVE-2026-56855","CVE-2026-71556","CVE-2026-71557","CVE-2026-78662","CVE-2026-84303","CVE-2026-84304","CVE-2026-84445"],"summary":"Security update for terraform-provider-aws, terraform-provider-azurerm, terraform-provider-external, terraform-provider-google, terraform-provider-helm, terraform-provider-kubernetes, terraform-provider-local, terraform-provider-null, terraform-provider-random, terraform-provider-tls","details":"This update for terraform-provider-aws, terraform-provider-azurerm, terraform-provider-external, terraform-provider-google, terraform-provider-helm, terraform-provider-kubernetes, terraform-provider-local, terraform-provider-null, terraform-provider-random, terraform-provider-tls fixes the following issues:\n\nSecurity issues fixed:\n\n- CVE-2026-44740: github.com/go-git/go-billy/v5: improper input handling in many components can lead to DoS via infinite\n  loops, panics or resource consumption (bsc#1267271 bsc#1267273 bsc#1267276).\n- CVE-2026-56854,CVE-2026-56855,CVE-2026-78662: golang.org/x/crypto/ssh: authentication bypass and deadlocks in the\n  crypto/ssh library (bsc#1278462 bsc#1278477 bsc#1278505).\n- CVE-2026-71556: github.com/go-git/go-git/v5: Arbitrary file read/write via symbolic link resolution (bsc#1276980).\n- CVE-2026-71557: github.com/go-git/go-git/v5: Malicious reference names may modify files outside the reference storage\n  (bsc#1276990).\n- CVE-2026-84303: github.com/grpc/grpc-go: xDS RBAC HTTP filter implementation issue allows for bypass of authorization\n  policies via mixed-case or canonical-case header matches (bsc#1278269 bsc#1279243 bsc#1279245 bsc#1279252 bsc#1279263\n  bsc#1279386).\n- CVE-2026-84304: github.com/grpc/grpc-go: heap memory exhaustion via HTTP/2 DATA frame fragmentation (bsc#1278272\n  bsc#1279072 bsc#1279080 bsc#1279137).\n- CVE-2026-84445: google.golang.org/grpc: DoS via crash due to missing ':authority' and 'Host' headers in gRPC-Go xDS\n  servers (bsc#1278742 bsc#1278743 bsc#1278751 bsc#1278763).\n- gRPC-Go: several issues affecting the xDS RBAC authorization engine and the HTTP/2 transport server implementation\n  (bsc#1278267).\n\nNon security issue fixed:\n\n- terraform-provider-{aws,external,google,random,tls}: aarch64 build installs provider binary under linux_amd64 instead\n  of linux_arm64, breaking terraform init (bsc#1280175).\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"terraform-provider-aws","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Module for Public Cloud 15 SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/terraform-provider-aws&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Module%20for%20Public%20Cloud%2015%20SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.11.0-150200.6.29.2"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"terraform-provider-aws":"3.11.0-150200.6.29.2","terraform-provider-azurerm":"2.32.0-150200.6.23.2","terraform-provider-external":"2.0.0-150200.6.23.2","terraform-provider-google":"3.43.0-150200.6.23.2","terraform-provider-helm":"2.9.0-150200.6.34.2","terraform-provider-kubernetes":"1.13.2-150200.6.23.2","terraform-provider-local":"2.0.0-150200.6.30.2","terraform-provider-null":"3.0.0-150200.6.32.2","terraform-provider-random":"3.0.0-150200.6.26.2","terraform-provider-tls":"3.0.0-150200.5.26.2"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-2026:4628-1.json"}},{"package":{"name":"terraform-provider-azurerm","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Module for Public Cloud 15 SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/terraform-provider-azurerm&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Module%20for%20Public%20Cloud%2015%20SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.32.0-150200.6